{
    "$comment": [
        "Manifest for examples/update-screenshots.ps1 - regenerates the documentation",
        "screenshots in docs/assets/screenshots{,-3D} by running the examples with the",
        "unattended screenshot protocol implemented in examples/common/qwt_example_screenshot.h.",
        "",
        "Entry fields:",
        "  name      example target name ( executable in <build>/bin, Debug adds a 'd' suffix )",
        "  shots[]   one capture per entry:",
        "    output   path relative to docs/assets",
        "    size     window size WxH passed as --size ( = output image size )",
        "    delay    milliseconds passed as --screenshot-delay ( optional, default below )",
        "    variant  visual variant passed as --variant ( optional, see addVariant in main.cpp )",
        "    args     extra command line arguments ( optional )",
        "  raw       examples with their own capture mode ( e.g. colormap ):",
        "    args     arguments, {assets} is replaced by the absolute docs/assets path",
        "    outputs  files that must exist after the run ( relative to docs/assets )",
        "    postMove [from, to] pairs applied after a successful run ( relative to docs/assets )",
        "  skipped[] outputs that cannot be regenerated, with the reason ( documentation only )",
        "",
        "New entries: add the example's shots here, integrate the helper into its main.cpp",
        "and rerun:  powershell -File examples/update-screenshots.ps1 -Only <name>"
    ],
    "defaults": {
        "delay": 2000,
        "timeoutPadSec": 20
    },
    "examples": [
        {
            "name": "animation",
            "shots": [
                { "output": "screenshots/animated.png", "size": "400x376", "delay": 2500 }
            ]
        },
